<title>USA: Frontier Airlines to lease Boeing 737-300.</title>
<headline>Frontier Airlines to lease Boeing 737-300.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frontier Airlines Inc said Friday it agreed to lease a new Boeing 737-300 jet from GE Capital Aviation Services.</p>
<p>The 138-seat aircraft is scheduled to be delivered to Frontier in August 1997.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Frontier previously said it will take delivery of another new 737-300 in April 1997 from International Lease Finance Corp.</p>
<p>The airline's present nine-jet fleet includes two 737-300s and seven smaller 737-200s.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
